{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 166,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        527.308349609375,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "This group should be established early in the guideline development process, once the Steering",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.96579647064209,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.7740478515625,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "Group has defined the guideline’s general scope and target audience, and has begun drafting",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.993898391723633,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.7060546875,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "the key questions. The GDG should be composed of relevant technical experts; end-users, such",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.986091613769531,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        526.9656372070312,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "as programme managers and health professionals, who will adopt, adapt and implement the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        526.964599609375,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "guideline; representatives of groups most affected by the guideline’s recommendations, such",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        526.947998046875,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "as service users and representatives of disadvantaged groups; experts in assessing evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        162.16119384765625,
        526.6272583007812,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "and developing guidelines informed by evidence; and other technical experts as required (e.g.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.995599746704102,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        177.66119384765625,
        412.2130432128906,
        190.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "a health economist or an expert on equity, human rights and gender).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        201.66522216796875,
        527.1676635742188,
        214.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations are developed based on consensus among GDG members, where possible.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.990195274353027,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        217.16522216796875,
        526.8024291992188,
        230.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "When it is not possible to reach consensus, a vote is taken. When a draft guideline is developed",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.977477073669434,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        232.66522216796875,
        526.9259643554688,
        245.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "by a WHO steering committee, it is reviewed initially by GDG members and subsequently by",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        248.16522216796875,
        526.968994140625,
        261.31024169921875
      ],
      "text": "an External Review Group (ERG). The ERG is made up of individuals interested in the subject,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        263.66522216796875,
        526.9076538085938,
        276.81024169921875
      ],
      "text": "and may include the same categories of specialists as the GDG. When the ERG reviews the final",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.984739303588867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.16522216796875,
        526.9920654296875,
        292.31024169921875
      ],
      "text": "guideline, its role is to identify any errors or missing data, and to comment on clarity, setting,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        294.66522216796875,
        526.9572143554688,
        307.81024169921875
      ],
      "text": "specific issues and implications for implementation – not to change the recommendations",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        310.16522216796875,
        203.76620483398438,
        323.31024169921875
      ],
      "text": "formulated by the GDG  . (2)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.6767272949219,
        315.9305114746094,
        352.05670166015625
      ],
      "text": "Formulation of the recommendations",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        362.3076171875,
        526.5055541992188,
        375.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "Evidence is synthesized and presented in GRADE evidence tables. The evidence to decision (EtD)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.956413269042969,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        377.8076171875,
        526.9478759765625,
        390.95263671875
      ],
      "text": "framework is used subsequently to facilitate consideration of the evidence and development",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        393.3076171875,
        526.9480590820312,
        406.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "of recommendations in a structured and transparent manner. Finally, recommendations are",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        408.8076171875,
        527.025146484375,
        421.95263671875
      ],
      "text": "developed based on consensus among GDG members where possible. If it is not possible",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        424.3076171875,
        527.0029907226562,
        437.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "to reach consensus, then voting takes place. Decisions on the direction and strength of the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        439.8076171875,
        359.2716369628906,
        452.95263671875
      ],
      "text": "recommendations are also made using the EtD framework.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        462.3116149902344,
        526.9486694335938,
        475.4566345214844
      ],
      "text": "Factors that influenced the direction and strength of a recommendation in this guideline were:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.975021362304688,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        482.0635986328125,
        78.81909942626953,
        495.2086181640625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        482.0635986328125,
        189.16409301757812,
        495.2086181640625
      ],
      "text": "priority of a problem;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        497.5635986328125,
